OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for indoor waste site
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plant at High Heavens, off Clay
OL,7,FLane, would process between 5,500 and
OL,8,F10,000 tonnes of waste each year. This
OL,9,Fincludes bulky household items and
OL,10,Fupholstered furniture that may contain
OL,11,Fpersistent organic pollutants, known as
OL,12,FPOPs.
